{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00243",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.39,
      "end_seconds": 4.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Good evening, doctor, thank you for staying late."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.62,
      "end_seconds": 10.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "So, yes, come in, take a seat. What can I do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.62,
      "end_seconds": 21.76,
      "duration_seconds": 10.14,
      "text": "It's breathlessness on the stairs, mostly. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.84,
      "end_seconds": 24.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "How long have you had it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.87,
      "end_seconds": 33.9,
      "duration_seconds": 8.03,
      "text": "It's been going on for two weeks. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.18,
      "end_seconds": 41.91,
      "duration_seconds": 6.73,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind. I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.64,
      "end_seconds": 51.46,
      "duration_seconds": 8.82,
      "text": "It's once or twice a day. A five out of ten, I suppose. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.06,
      "end_seconds": 54.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Anything that tends to go along with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.43,
      "end_seconds": 61.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "Dizziness goes along with it, most of the time. The dizziness? That's been since Friday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.25,
      "end_seconds": 68.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "Have you had breathlessness on the stairs before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.77,
      "end_seconds": 74.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "A bit, last year. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.83,
      "end_seconds": 79.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any heavy periods or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.64,
      "end_seconds": 81.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "No, none of those."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.72,
      "end_seconds": 83.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "I see. Any chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.93,
      "end_seconds": 86.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "No, no chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.19,
      "end_seconds": 89.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.1,
      "end_seconds": 91.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "No, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.33,
      "end_seconds": 95.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.54,
      "end_seconds": 99.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Omeprazole. I take it 20 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.64,
      "end_seconds": 102.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "How long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.41,
      "end_seconds": 104.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "About three months now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.39,
      "end_seconds": 113.97,
      "duration_seconds": 8.58,
      "text": "So, do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.56,
      "end_seconds": 116.35,
      "duration_seconds": 0.79,
      "text": "No allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.11,
      "end_seconds": 122.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.19,
      "end_seconds": 134.36,
      "duration_seconds": 11.17,
      "text": "Yes, uh, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.96,
      "end_seconds": 135.95,
      "duration_seconds": 0.99,
      "text": "How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.04,
      "end_seconds": 139.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "No, I don't smoke and never have."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.53,
      "end_seconds": 141.46,
      "duration_seconds": 0.93,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.01,
      "end_seconds": 145.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "A beer or two most evenings, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.61,
      "end_seconds": 147.58,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.04,
      "end_seconds": 152.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "I had a hernia repair about five years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.32,
      "end_seconds": 156.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "I'll try to keep this as efficient as I can."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.11,
      "end_seconds": 159.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "So, thank you, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.76,
      "end_seconds": 165.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.61,
      "end_seconds": 167.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "I've had acid reflux, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.58,
      "end_seconds": 175.14,
      "duration_seconds": 6.56,
      "text": "Okay, acid reflux, that's already on your record. Good to know. I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.91,
      "end_seconds": 190.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "Hold still for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.23,
      "end_seconds": 212.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 125 over 72, pulse is 114 beats a minute, temperature 37.1."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.56,
      "end_seconds": 214.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.12,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.49,
      "end_seconds": 218.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.49,
      "end_seconds": 224.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.3,
      "end_seconds": 226.0,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.03,
      "end_seconds": 229.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Can you lie back for me?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.75,
      "end_seconds": 245.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Heart sounds are normal, I don't hear any murmur."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 246.76,
      "end_seconds": 247.46,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.06,
      "end_seconds": 251.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "Stay still while I have a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.35,
      "end_seconds": 268.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "Your eyelids are pale inside."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.4,
      "end_seconds": 293.17,
      "duration_seconds": 19.77,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on. So, based on the history and the examination, this looks most like anaemia of some kind. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.59,
      "end_seconds": 296.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Right, doctor, is this dangerous?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.39,
      "end_seconds": 315.41,
      "duration_seconds": 17.02,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's anaemia of some kind, and we'll know more once the a full blood count is back. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had breathlessness on the stairs for two weeks, and no chest pain or fainting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.43,
      "end_seconds": 317.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.01,
      "end_seconds": 328.42,
      "duration_seconds": 9.41,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a full blood count for pallor. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 329.67,
      "end_seconds": 331.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "The earliest is Monday, 10 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 332.44,
      "end_seconds": 334.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Monday, that works for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.64,
      "end_seconds": 357.17,
      "duration_seconds": 19.53,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a vitamin B12 level for possible deficiency. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. I'd like you to take ferrous sulfate, 200 milligrams, once a day, for three months. That should help with possible iron deficiency. Iron can darken the stools and bother the stomach, so take it after food."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 357.76,
      "end_seconds": 373.93,
      "duration_seconds": 16.17,
      "text": "Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 375.22,
      "end_seconds": 377.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "Yes, I'll do that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 377.85,
      "end_seconds": 381.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 381.64,
      "end_seconds": 382.34,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 383.46,
      "end_seconds": 384.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Good. Look after yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 385.74,
      "end_seconds": 389.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "I think that's clear. Thank you for being so thorough."
    }
  ]
}